<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%# Pass pageTitle variable to the header partial %>
    <%- include('partials/header', { pageTitle: pageTitle || "AI Startup Consultation" }) %>
    <style>
        /* --- Styles Specific to this Page --- */
        /* (Consider moving to style.css) */

        /* Layout for main content sections */
        main > .section:not(:first-child) {
            margin-top: 3rem; /* Add space between form/results and placeholders */
            padding-top: 3rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        /* Case Study / Report Card Styling (ensure these are also in style.css) */
        .case-study-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; text-align: left; }
        .case-study-card { border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--white); box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .case-study-card h5 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-blue); }
        .case-study-card p { font-size: 0.9em; color: var(--text-medium); flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .case-study-tags { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .tag { display: inline-block; background-color: #e2e3e5; color: #5a6268; padding: 0.25em 0.6em; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.8em; margin-right: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.3em; }
        .tag-saas { background-color: #d1ecf1; color: #0c5460; } .tag-growth { background-color: #d4edda; color: #155724; } .tag-ecommerce { background-color: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; } .tag-ops { background-color: #fff3cd; color: #856404; } .tag-fintech { background-color: #cce5ff; color: #004085; } .tag-digital { background-color: #e2e3e5; color: #383d41; }
        .case-study-trigger { background-color: var(--secondary-blue); color: white; border: none; padding: 0.6rem 1rem; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 0.2s ease; align-self: flex-start; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: auto; }
        .case-study-trigger:hover { background-color: var(--primary-blue); }

        .reports-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 700px; margin: auto; }
        .report-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--white); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease; }
        .report-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .report-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--secondary-blue); flex-shrink: 0; width: 40px; text-align: center; }
        .report-content { flex-grow: 1; text-align: left; }
        .report-content strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--primary-blue); font-size: 1.1em; }
        .report-content p { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.95em; color: var(--text-medium); }
        .report-content a { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9em; }

        /* Modal Styles (ensure these exist in style.css) */
        .modal-overlay { position: fixed; z-index: 2000; left: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow-y: auto; background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.65); display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: opacity 0.3s ease, visibility 0s linear 0.3s; padding: 1rem; }
        .modal-overlay.visible { display: flex; opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transition: opacity 0.3s ease; }
        .modal-content { background-color: #fefefe; margin: auto; padding: 25px 30px; border: 1px solid #bbb; width: 90%; border-radius: 10px; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); transform: translateY(-20px) scale(0.98); transition: transform 0.3s ease-out; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto; }
        .modal-overlay.visible .modal-content { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
        .modal-close-button { color: #888; position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 15px; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer; line-height: 1; padding: 0; z-index: 2001; transition: color 0.2s ease;}
        .modal-close-button:hover, .modal-close-button:focus { color: #333; }
        #case-study-modal .modal-content { max-width: 700px; }
        #modal-body h4 { color: var(--primary-blue); margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 600; }
        #modal-body p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        #modal-tags { margin-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 1rem; }
        #modal-tags .tag { margin-top: 0.5em; }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar', { content: typeof content !== 'undefined' ? content : {} }) %>

    <main>
        <div class="section">
             <%- include('partials/startup_form') %>
        </div>


         <div class="section">
             <h2>Relevant Case Studies</h2>
             <p class="text-center mb-4">Explore examples of successful strategies and transformations in various industries.</p>
             <div class="case-study-grid">
                 <div class="case-study-card">
                     <h5>Case Study 1: SaaS Growth Acceleration</h5>
                     <div class="case-study-tags"> <span class="tag tag-saas">SaaS</span> <span class="tag tag-growth">Growth Marketing</span> </div>
                     <p>How Company X doubled its MRR...</p>
                     <button class="case-study-trigger" data-casestudyid="cs1">View Details (STAR)</button>
                 </div>
                 <div class="case-study-card">
                      <h5>Case Study 2: E-commerce Optimization</h5>
                      <div class="case-study-tags"> <span class="tag tag-ecommerce">E-commerce</span> <span class="tag tag-ops">Operations</span> </div>
                     <p>Reducing fulfillment costs by 20%...</p>
                     <button class="case-study-trigger" data-casestudyid="cs2">View Details (STAR)</button>
                 </div>
                 <div class="case-study-card">
                     <h5>Case Study 3: FinTech Transformation</h5>
                      <div class="case-study-tags"> <span class="tag tag-fintech">FinTech</span> <span class="tag tag-digital">Digital Transformation</span> </div>
                     <p>Implementing a new digital platform...</p>
                      <button class="case-study-trigger" data-casestudyid="cs3">View Details (STAR)</button>
                 </div>
             </div>
             </div>

        <div class="section section-shaded">
             <h2>Industry Reports & Data</h2>
             <p class="text-center mb-4">Access market trends, benchmarks, and insights relevant to your sector.</p>
             <div class="reports-list">
                  <div class="report-card">
                      <i class="fas fa-chart-pie report-icon"></i>
                      <div class="report-content">
                          <strong>Global SaaS Market Trends 2025</strong>
                          <p>Analysis of growth drivers, competitive landscape, and future outlook.</p>
                          <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Example Link</a>
                      </div>
                  </div>
                   <div class="report-card">
                      <i class="fas fa-piggy-bank report-icon"></i>
                      <div class="report-content">
                          <strong>FinTech Funding Report Q1 2025</strong>
                          <p>Insights into venture capital trends and key investment areas in FinTech.</p>
                           <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Example Link</a>
                      </div>
                  </div>
                   <div class="report-card">
                      <i class="fas fa-shopping-cart report-icon"></i>
                      <div class="report-content">
                          <strong>E-commerce Consumer Behavior Analysis</strong>
                          <p>Understanding changing patterns in online shopping post-pandemic.</p>
                           <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Example Link</a>
                      </div>
                  </div>
                  </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer', { current_year: typeof current_year !== 'undefined' ? current_year : new Date().getFullYear() }) %>

    <div id="case-study-modal" class="modal-overlay">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <button class="modal-close-button">&times;</button> 
            <h3 id="modal-title" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Case Study Details</h3>
            <div id="modal-body">
                <h4>Situation:</h4> <p id="modal-situation">...</p>
                <h4>Task:</h4> <p id="modal-task">...</p>
                <h4>Action:</h4> <p id="modal-action">...</p>
                <h4>Result:</h4> <p id="modal-result">...</p>
            </div>
            <div id="modal-tags" style="margin-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 1rem;">
                <strong>Tags:</strong> </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
